+        #     ``(data, terms)`` 2-tuple, so the unpacking below is safe.
+        # The autograd vjp therefore captures NN + short-range + DFTD3 +
+        # Coulomb-charge-response, matching the dense assembly term-by-term.
+        external_hessian = method == "dsf"
